<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Autozone downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Autozone downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Raymond James said it lowered its recommendation on AutoZone Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Harry Katica was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- In midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade, the stock was off 5/8 to 30 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
